<title>ARGENTINA: RESEARCH ALERT - Flemings ups Argentina's Quilmes.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Flemings ups Argentina's Quilmes.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flemings Research said it upgraded Argentine brewer Quilmes to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;reduce.&quot;</p>
<p>- &quot;Quilmes' first quarter 1997 results reflect volume recuperation and a better pricing environment in its core Argentine beer segment,&quot; Flemings said.</p>
<p>- It predicted sales will rise to $968.5 million in 1997 and $1.01 billion in 1998 after sales of $831.9 million last year.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
</text>
